Install local graph backend tooling

Usage:
  eshu install [command]

Available Commands:
  nornicdb    Install the local NornicDB binary

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for install

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu install [command] --help" for more information about a command.
